        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji ngelo ya kufwa kwake Israeli yalighisa, ukammbanga mwana wake Josefu ukamzera, “Ngera narumirikia mesonyi kwako, ngira mkonu ghwako barenyi kwapo, nao kunighemie angu kuchanibonyera malagho gha loli na gha hachi.",
